{
 "component": "ChoiceChips",
 "version": 1,
 "summary": "A labelled single choice: one short call makes a heading and a wrapping group of pills, a tap selects that item (a repeat tap keeps it, the others clear), and a screen reader hears the group with each item (\"Tip: 15%\", Selected). `selected` holds the 0-based index. style segmented uses Tabs' sliding pill instead of pills.",
 "params": {
  "items": {
   "type": "list",
   "required": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "The choices, e.g. [\"10%\", \"15%\", \"20%\"]; fixed when the document is built"
  },
  "label": {
   "type": "string",
   "required": true,
   "doc": "What is being chosen (\"Tip\"): the visible heading and, in style chips, the start of each pill's accessibility label. A literal, not a text variable"
  },
  "selected": {
   "type": "variable",
   "initial": 0,
   "doc": "The selected index, 0-based. Declare it in resources.variables and bind it to read or preset it (\"@tip\"); turn the index into what it means in an expression (\"10 + 5 * @tip\") or show text for it with TextChoice"
  },
  "style": {
   "type": "enum",
   "values": [
    "chips",
    "segmented"
   ],
   "default": "chips",
   "static": true,
   "doc": "chips: pills that wrap to more lines when narrow. segmented: a Tabs track of equal widths, one line, never wraps; for two to four short items"
  },
  "showLabel": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "false hides the heading when the screen already shows it. In style chips the pills still say the label; in style segmented nothing does, so keep it"
  },
  "color": {
   "type": "color",
   "default": "@colors.primary",
   "doc": "The selected face; its label is onPrimary"
  },
  "onClick": {
   "type": "action",
   "doc": "Extra actions run on every tap, a repeat tap too, after `selected` is set: they read the NEW index, if they read @selected itself (not a variable derived from it). An action that must run once per change has to compare it with a copy of the old one (CMP-25)"
  }
 },
 "capabilities": [
  "input.tap",
  "layout.decoration",
  "a11y.labels"
 ],
 "call": {
  "ChoiceChips": {
   "label": "Tip",
   "items": [
    "10%",
    "15%",
    "20%"
   ],
   "selected": "@tip"
  }
 },
 "pitfalls": [
  "`selected` is the index, not a value: compute the value from it in the document (\"10 + 5 * @tip\"). A preset outside the list selects nothing until the next tap",
  "In `onClick`, read @selected directly in the action's own expression. A variable derived from it in resources (\"changed\": \"abs(@unit - @was)\") still holds last frame's value during the tap, so it silently gives the old answer; CMP-25 hit this",
  "Not for several independent on/off filters (use Chip) or a tab bar over panels (use Tabs). TextChoice only shows a word for an index: it takes no input, and pairs well with this for the result",
  "Style chips wraps by itself (a `flow`): give it width and let its height grow; every line is 48 dp, all clickable, so don't put it in a box of fixed height. A label wider than the whole line ends in …",
  "Style segmented is Tabs: it never wraps, and its tabs announce only their item (\"Metric\", Selected), after the heading in reading order. The chips style says the group in each item (\"Tip: 15%\")",
  "Always expanded, never a pattern (its text and state ops): about 570 B per item and 850 B once per call (a three-item group is 2.6 KB alone, 1.8 KB as a second group in the same document; three plain Chips are 2.2 KB). A long list of choices belongs in a list, not pills",
  "Mono: the selected pill is filled and the others are rings, so the state is a shape; no motion",
  "`label` is required on purpose: without it a screen reader hears \"10%\" and no question"
 ],
 "body": {
  "column": {
   "modifiers": [
    "fillMaxWidth"
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "$if": "showLabel",
     "then": {
      "text": {
       "value": "@label",
       "fontSize": "@theme.text_md",
       "color": "@colors.muted",
       "modifiers": [
        {
         "$if": "style == 'segmented'",
         "then": {
          "padding": {
           "bottom": 4
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "$if": "style == 'segmented'",
     "then": {
      "Tabs": {
       "labels": "@items",
       "style": "segmented",
       "selected": "@selected",
       "color": "@color",
       "onClick": "@onClick"
      }
     },
     "else": {
      "flow": {
       "modifiers": [
        "fillMaxWidth"
       ],
       "children": [
        {
         "canvas": {
          "modifiers": [
           {
            "size": [
             0,
             0
            ]
           }
          ],
          "commands": [
           {
            "global": {
             "commands": [
              {
               "$each": "items",
               "index": "i",
               "do": [
                {
                 "textSubtext": {
                  "text": "Not selectedSelected    ",
                  "start": "(1 - min(1, abs(@selected - @i))) * 12",
                  "len": 12,
                  "varName": "ccState12_@i"
                 }
                },
                {
                 "textTransform": {
                  "text": "@ccState12_@i",
                  "start": 0,
                  "len": -1,
                  "operation": 3,
                  "varName": "ccState_@i"
                 }
                }
               ]
              }
             ]
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "$each": "items",
         "as": "item",
         "index": "i",
         "do": {
          "box": {
           "modifiers": [
            {
             "padding": {
              "end": 8
             }
            }
           ],
           "children": [
            {
             "box": {
              "modifiers": [
               {
                "padding": [
                 0,
                 8
                ]
               },
               {
                "clip": 16
               },
               {
                "semantics": {
                 "contentDescription": "@label: @item",
                 "stateDescription": "@ccState_@i",
                 "clickable": true
                }
               },
               {
                "onClick": [
                 {
                  "type": "valueFloatChange",
                  "target": "@selected",
                  "value": "@i"
                 },
                 {
                  "$if": "onClick",
                  "then": "@onClick"
                 }
                ]
               }
              ],
              "children": [
               {
                "box": {
                 "horizontalAlignment": "center",
                 "verticalAlignment": "center",
                 "modifiers": [
                  {
                   "height": 32
                  },
                  {
                   "$if": "theme.mono",
                   "then": {
                    "background": "@colors.outline"
                   },
                   "auto": [
                    {
                     "background": "@colors.surfaceHigh"
                    },
                    {
                     "background": "@colors.monoOutline"
                    }
                   ]
                  },
                  {
                   "$if": "theme.mono",
                   "then": {
                    "padding": 1
                   },
                   "auto": {
                    "padding": 1
                   }
                  },
                  {
                   "$if": "theme.mono",
                   "then": {
                    "clip": 15
                   },
                   "auto": {
                    "clip": 15
                   }
                  },
                  {
                   "background": "@colors.surfaceHigh"
                  },
                  {
                   "padding": [
                    {
                     "$if": "theme.mono",
                     "then": 13,
                     "else": 14,
                     "auto": 13
                    },
                    0
                   ]
                  }
                 ],
                 "children": [
                  {
                   "text": {
                    "value": "@item",
                    "maxLines": 1,
                    "overflow": "ellipsis",
                    "fontSize": 14,
                    "color": "@colors.onSurface"
                   }
                  }
                 ]
                }
               },
               {
                "box": {
                 "horizontalAlignment": "center",
                 "verticalAlignment": "center",
                 "modifiers": [
                  {
                   "graphicsLayer": {
                    "alpha": {
                     "value": "1 - min(1, abs(@selected - @i))",
                     "anim": 0.2
                    }
                   }
                  },
                  {
                   "height": 32
                  },
                  {
                   "background": "@color"
                  },
                  {
                   "padding": [
                    14,
                    0
                   ]
                  }
                 ],
                 "children": [
                  {
                   "text": {
                    "value": "@item",
                    "maxLines": 1,
                    "overflow": "ellipsis",
                    "fontSize": 14,
                    "color": "@colors.onPrimary"
                   }
                  }
                 ]
                }
               }
              ]
             }
            }
           ]
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
